Subject: [PATCH 2/2] role: define the backup transport role

Define android.app.role.BACKUP_TRANSPORT with a required
android.backup.TRANSPORT_HOST service, grant BACKUP on role grant, and add
the consent strings and behavior class.

Bug: 0
Test: m PermissionController
Change-Id: Ibaf8ac28937fba7ea6bc1cb0b1bc179554683d3e
